Subject: [PATCH 1/2] odroid-go-ultra: update bl301.bin to Hardkernel 923594290

bl301.bin for odroid-go-ultra is built from hardkernel/u-boot
odroidgoU-v2015.01 at 7f68d7d79 (2022-09-26). This rebuilds it at
923594290 (2023-01-09), which includes f6bc1fb85: the power key
wakeup source is GPIOAO_5 on this board, not GPIOAO_3.

Toolchain: Linaro arm-none-eabi 4.8-2014.04, which rebuilds the
current blob byte for byte at 7f68d7d79.
